{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29647","headline":"行至金牛驿寄兴元渤海尚书 · 李商隐","name":"行至金牛驿寄兴元渤海尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼上春云水底天，五云章色破巴牋。\n诸生个个王恭柳，从事人人庾杲莲。\n六曲屏风江雨急，九枝灯檠夜珠圆。\n深慙走马金牛路，骤和陈王白玉篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}